spell.core.airElemental.description.adva:
{Advanced Summon Air Elemental}

Allows you to summon Air Elementals.

Summons approximately one-and-a-half times the number of units as Basic Summon Air Elemental.

spell.core.airElemental.description.expe:
{Expert Summon Air Elemental}

Allows you to summon Air Elementals.

Summons approximately twice the number of units as Basic Summon Air Elemental.

